OL,5,G0350 Wild West: America's Great
OL,6,G     Frontier
OL,7,     FThe High Country: America's High
OL,8,     FCountry is the land of grizzly
OL,9,     Fbears, giant trees, frigid
OL,10,     Fwinters, scorching summers, tough
OL,11,     Franchers and gold-rush fever.
OL,12,G0440 World's Greatest Palaces
OL,13,     FKensington Palace: Kensington
OL,14,     FPalace, which began life as an
OL,15,     Fearly 17th-century Jacobean
OL,16,     Fmansion before becoming a palace
OL,17,     Ffit for the monarchy, and was the
OL,18,     Fbrainchild of Christopher Wren.
